<view class="page">
  <view class="hero">
    <view class="hero-title">排球办赛助手</view>
    <view class="hero-sub">建赛 → 规程 → 报名 → 抽签 → 赛程 → 记分 → 成绩，微信内全程办赛</view>
    <view class="hero-btn" bindtap="goCreate">＋ 新建赛事</view>
  </view>

  <view class="sec-title">我的赛事（{{myEvents.length}}）</view>
  <view class="empty" wx:if="{{!loading && !myEvents.length}}">
    还没有赛事，点上方「新建赛事」用一句话开始办赛
  </view>
  <view class="card event-card" wx:for="{{myEvents}}" wx:key="_id" data-id="{{item._id}}" bindtap="goDetail">
    <view class="event-top">
      <view class="event-name">{{item.name}}</view>
      <view class="tag {{item.status === 'ended' ? 'tag-gray' : 'tag-blue'}}">{{item.statusText}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="event-sub">球种/局制已定 · {{item.teamCount || 0}} 队报名</view>
    <view class="event-step">下一步：{{item.stepName}} →</view>
  </view>
</view>
